      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "噂が間違いだと良いけど……、\nパルミエルさーん！　パルミエルさーん、居ますかー！？",
      "jp_sha256": "cf63a79b70db666acd0490d32ccd9551394630a7acb8fab7ce571cd3413ebd77",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "소문이 틀렸으면 좋겠는데…….\n팔미엘 씨―! 팔미엘 씨, 계세요―!?",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
